          }
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# A Real Type System Is Emerging\n\nTwilite already has reusable:\n\n- node classes\n- edge classes\n- bridges\n- declarations\n- views\n- surfaces\n- tutorial primitives\n- publishing kits\n\nA tutorial can have structural concepts such as title, concept, example, challenge, and checkpoint.\n\nTyped nodes and semantic edges turn the product into a runtime, not a whiteboard.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
