      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# GitHub-Backed Persistence\n\nGitHub supplies:\n\n- durable files\n- version history\n- identity\n- collaboration\n- publishing\n- transport\n\nThe underlying truth remains understandable:\n\n> A graph is a file.  \n> A graph can link to another graph.  \n> A graph can be versioned and published.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
