        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# The Product Challenge\n\nThe question is no longer whether the architecture is substantial.\n\nThe challenge is whether users perceive the power before the machinery overwhelms them.\n\n## Three Ruthless Priorities\n\n1. **First successful action**  \n   Ask for a change, paste it into Twilite, watch the graph change.\n\n2. **A seductive visible graph**  \n   The JSON is the engine room. The canvas is the ballroom.\n\n3. **Layered vocabulary**  \n   Reveal declaration, bridge, port, portal, view, surface, and class concepts gradually.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
