      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Updated Verdict\n\nTwilite is becoming a graph-shaped web application model:\n\n- GitHub-backed graph documents\n- graph addressing\n- navigable graph spaces\n- reusable graph-native components\n- declared presentation surfaces\n- semantic node and edge classes\n- AI-authored transactional mutations\n- inspectable agent workflows\n- future 3D rendering over the same structure\n\nIt has crossed from an interesting interface idea into a coherent system architecture.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
